WEBVTT

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
bokura nara daijoubu

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:05.930
Because we’re still doing okay,

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:12.390
we can become even stronger!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
takaihiroi sora megake

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.900
Aiming for the tall and wide sky,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
kinou made no boku wo hanatsu

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.450
I let go of what I was up until yesterday.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
miesuita uso mo, taikutsu na

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.260
Those lies that were easily seen through and my tedious day-by-day life;

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
hibi mo, zenbu hodoite

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.980
I left them both behind.

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
atarashii asa ni me wo hosome

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.870
I narrowed my eyes at the new morning

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
kyou mo bokutachi wa ikiteku

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.280
Today we shall also venture out
to live our lives again.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
sukoshi nami utsu sabishisadatte

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:36.720
Even the slight loneliness that sometimes comes about,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
taisetsu ni omoeteru

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.460
I consider important.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
itsuka kanjita shinjitsu mo

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:45.070
Even the truth I felt some day…

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
massugu koko kara asu ni mukatteru

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.440
…is urging us to go on into the future.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
bokutachi ga mezashita sekai

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
The world that we had all aimed for…

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:03.470
donna kakomo kakaeta mama kitto tadoritsuku

00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:03.470
We will arrive at it, no matter what our pasts are.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.460
fumidashita kewashii michi mo

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.460
We continued forward, even if it is a steep path…

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.900
bokura nara daijoubu,

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.900
…because we’re still doing okay,

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
mada tsuyoku nareru kara

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:18.280
and we can become even stronger!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.200
You’re pretty good at drawing, Soujyu.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.090
You think so? You’re the only person who tells me that, Sara-chan.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:49.520
I’m saying it because I think you should be an artist.

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.490
An artist?

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:51.320
Yeah.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.050
I’m sure many people will come to love your drawings, Soujyu.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.360
But…

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:01.430
Me too. I’m not too familiar with art, but I do like your work, Soujyu-chan.

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:07.440
A dream?

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.530
I dreamt about Onii-san…

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.580
If you make Soujyu cry,
I will never forgive you!

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.710
Break off all relations with the other girls, and go out with Soujyu!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:30.960
Eh?

00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:33.950
Soujyu is a pure girl, like an angel.

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.170
So don’t make her sad!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:38.110
W-Wait a second!

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:39.130
Who are you?

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.710
I’m Soujyu’s twin sister, Sara!

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:43.180
Again with the twins?

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.730
So you’re the younger one.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.730
Forget about me. Soujyu is really serious about you.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.860
Return her love!

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.290
Return her love!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.150
Return her love!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.200
“Return her love”
is easier said than done.

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.340
What are you mulling over?

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:05.520
What the…?

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.670
Cut it out!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.830
Don’t be like that.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.670
This mummy is pretty realistic, huh?

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:19.080
I had Dr. Momoi wrap it up for me in the infirmary earlier.

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:22.820
You look just like a victim.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:26.100
Ah, Kira and Yura, what’re you going to dress up as?

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.590
We’re dressing up as mermaids.

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:31.370
It’s really difficult to sew
on these scales.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:35.520
You didn’t buy a costume at the costume shop last week?

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:38.050
Yes, we did.

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.390
But Kenmochi-san said it was a disgrace.

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:41.280
A disgrace?

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.480
“Those tiger-striped pants are unladylike.”

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:46.160
And the horns on the head…

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.370
Tiger stripes and horns?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.880
Note: Keisuke is imagining Lum from <i>Urusei Yatsura</i>.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.880
You mean that mainstream cosplay?

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:57.210
Oh, do you like that kind of thing, Kosaka-kun?

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:01.490
Dear Misses, with all due respect to the members of the Sakurazuki family,

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.930
I’m not sure those are suitable clothes.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.190
Note: These are male characters from <i>Urusei Yatsura</i>.

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:11.660
Oh man, I really wanted to see it.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.480
You’ve probably misunderstood something.

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.120
Soujyu-chan didn’t come today?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.010
Nope.

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:27.830
She didn’t come.

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:29.450
I see…

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:30.610
Are you worried?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:34.120
Worried? I’m just wondering if something happened.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.790
I wanted to leave some memories behind.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.320
So you  worried.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:42.820
Onee-chan is a good person, but no cheating on us, okay?

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:43.220
Eh?

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:47.040
That’s right! Onii-chan has Ruru and Rara.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.950
Are you okay with sitting up?

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.940
Yes, I’m just fine.

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.030
Did you go to see him?

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.790
I saw him in a dream.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:11.290
He said, “Now go home before you forget.”

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.710
You went to see him too, didn’t you, Sara-chan?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.920
I just wanted to see what kind of guy he is.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.460
Did you tell him we were moving?

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:21.500
No, I didn’t say.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:26.800
That’s good. Onii-san is a very gentle person, isn’t he?

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:29.270
Yes, but you have me, Soujyu.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:36.080
We’ve been together since we were born. No, since before we were born!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.100
Sara-chan…

00:05:37.950 --> 00:05:40.650
Soujyu, I will protect you.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:47.070
52nd Annual Souai Festival

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.580
It doesn’t look like Nozomu-chan’s here.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.120
We haven’t seen him in a while, have we?

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.620
Hey there!

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:08.760
Ah, sorry about that. It’s me, it’s me.
Sure is powered-up, isn’t it?

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.720
How can I help you? If you’re looking for Nozomu, he’s out shopping.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:19.200
Yes. We’re running a
magical café next door,

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:21.270
and we wanted to ask
Nozomu-chan something.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.770
Fukubukuya Department Store

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.550
Onii-san.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.370
Soujyu-chan.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.070
Are you okay? Is your cold better?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:48.580
Yes, but please keep this from Sara-chan.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:50.720
She worries quite a bit.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:54.140
Y-yeah, it certainly seems so.

00:06:54.840 --> 00:07:00.370
Everyone at school thinks she’s scary and hard to approach,

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.130
but Sara-chan is really gentle, actually.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:07.630
Yes, I believe she really treasures you.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:17.070
Note: Children traditionally receive gifts of money from relatives on New Year’s Day.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:17.070
Sara-chan bought these pastels with her New Year’s allowance.

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:18.750
Eh, is that so.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:23.250
She told me I’m talented at art,
and I should be an artist when I grow up.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:28.960
The way she said that
made me very happy.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.960
That’s why this is a treasure of mine.

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:37.370
Well, since I have to get back to the festival preparations…

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.350
It must be tough to stay out this late.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:46.050
Our class is doing a Horror Café – it’s like a mix of a haunted house and a café.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.170
Wow, that sounds interesting.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:52.200
If you’d like, I could guide you around. Why don’t you come and visit with Sara-chan?

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.410
Really?

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:54.820
Yup.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:02.750
I told you to stay in bed until you
completely recover from your cold.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.370
I’m sorry, Sara-chan. Are you angry?

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:11.600
No, since you’re feeling better,
I don’t mind. It’s just that guy…

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:12.720
Onii-san?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:16.750
The school cultural festival will be crowded and the air will probably be terrible.

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:21.530
If he’s asking you out on a date, there are countless better places he could invite you to.

00:08:21.530 --> 00:08:22.230
I see.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:26.160
So this is a date, then.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.520
A date with Sara-chan and Onii-san… the three of us…

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.320
The three of us?! Don’t say something so stupid!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.840
Café of Horrors

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:01.640
Thanks for waiting. Here’s your Count Dracula’s tomato juice.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.650
Oh, we’ll take it.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.560
We’re Mermaids.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.980
Do they look alright on us?

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.610
I don’t think those are mermaids…

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.950
Hey, Nozomu! A guest is here to see you.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.950
A very cute set of twins.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.160
Onii-san!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.620
It’s great you could come.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.830
I’ll be relieved soon, so do have some juice while waiting for me.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.230
What the hell is this stupid store?

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:30.200
It’s dark and foreboding and it gives me the creeps!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.190
Being in here is bad for your health!

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:33.760
Welcome.

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.730
W-What the hell are you?!

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:40.850
It’s okay, Sara-chan. It’s not real.

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:42.520
I-I know that!

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:48.180
Hey, it’s that girl. She came the other day and asked about you. She has a twin as well?!

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.460
Ah, yes. It seems so.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:53.570
Anyway, this place is too dark –
it stresses the heart.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:55.400
Turn on the lights! Where’s the switch?

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:59.920
And you’re just too damn scary!
Go over there! And there’s more!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:03.870
There’s plenty I want to yell at you about…

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.080
I wonder who those girls are.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:04.670
And how does Nozomu-kun know them?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:09.490
I’m not sure but they seem important, so why don’t we take their order?

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:10.570
Sounds good.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.760
What are you doing? That’s dangerous!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.200
Kira-chan! Yura-chan!

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:20.290
I mean really! This is unbecoming of a place of business.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:23.510
There’s a reason no one ever thought of a horror café!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:24.910
I won’t accept this!

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:25.830
You’re free to leave.

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.730
It’s just gross.

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.730
Just take those girls and show them elsewhere.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:32.080
And that costume has got to go; your clothes aren’t supposed to shock people!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.720
Huh? Kaoruko-chan?

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:10.770
And now for teleportation!
We’ll put a girl in this box…

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.020
and instantly transfer her to the box over here!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:23.210
One – Two – Three

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:24.870
NOW!

00:11:31.230 --> 00:11:32.530
BRAVO!

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.590
BRRRAVO!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:37.070
How absurd. They’re just twins.

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:40.630
Oh yeah. Why don’t you and Soujyu try it?

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:43.270
Idiot! Who would, in their right mind?

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:43.680
It sounds interesting.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:52.100
And now for teleportation!
We’ll put a girl in this box…

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:55.460
and instantly transfer her to the box over here!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.460
Ui-san! Koi-san!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.860
Ah, Nozomu-san!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.990
And now, she’ll go into the box.

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.410
You paid us a visit.

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.790
Yes, we saw the Horror Café.

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:16.100
And the Sakurazukis’ mermaid costumes were very cute.

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.080
Now!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.390
Hey, you over there! You’re too close! Back away!

00:12:20.390 --> 00:12:20.840
Eh?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:39.480
The magic act was a failure but it was still fun, wasn’t it, Sara-chan?

00:12:41.020 --> 00:12:44.770
Sara-chan, you looked really good in that costume. Right, Onii-san?

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:47.140
Yes, you looked great.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.540
Idiot, forget about me!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:54.130
More importantly, Soujyu, is your body alright now? You’re not tired?

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:58.330
I’m fine. You’re really a worrywart, Sara-chan.

00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.130
Ah, the art club!

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:24.650
So how’s our art club? Even rough wood can be made to shimmer.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:26.890
Yes, it’s wonderful.

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.410
Compared to these, Soujyu’s works are really skilfully done.

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.430
That’s right!

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.960
Soujyu-chan, why don’t you try doing some portraits?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.020
What? You want me to draw?

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.370
You’re trying to get her do stuff like that again!

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:45.050
It’ll be alright. I’m sure Soujyu-chan can do it. Can she please, Ai-sensei?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.600
Sure. Why don’t you give it a try?

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:53.650
Have faith in yourself. Remember how you drew Ruru-chan and Rara-chan at our place.

00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:54.440
Okay.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.410
Hmmm, she’s quite talented.

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:07.950
Isn’t she, though?

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.680
You’re really skilled!

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.210
Soujyu-chan, you’re really talented in art.

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.200
Yes. Ah, sorry about earlier.
We caused quite a bit of trouble.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:33.490
It’s alright. The magic act might have failed but the customers loved it.

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:34.600
I-Is that so?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.310
It was a success on the stage.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.310
That’s good.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:42.230
Ah, that reminds me. Kosaka-kun was looking for you, Nozomu-chan.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.560
Dagnabbit! You have to help out here a bit too, you know!

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.450
You’re hogging all the good memories for yourself!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.530
What happened to your mask?

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:53.450
Like I’d put it on when it’s this hot. Hurry up and get back to work.

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:09.200
The school festival will end soon.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.120
Can you help me put away the portraits?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:12.810
Sure.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.130
You get along well with
Nozomu-oniisan, don’t you?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.390
Yes, because we’ve been friends since we were young.

00:15:23.390 --> 00:15:25.650
During kindergarten,
we lived next to each other.

00:15:25.650 --> 00:15:28.150
Since that far back?

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:31.250
But we weren’t always together, were we?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:35.090
He moved away before we came to middle school.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:36.300
He moved away?

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:42.060
Yes, he came back just six months ago, and we got to play with each other again.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.710
But Nozomu-chan hasn’t changed the slightest, has he?

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:49.410
Yes, he’s the same as back then. Huh? What’s the matter?

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:52.220
I’ll be moving out of this town as well, next week.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:56.500
That’s why I wanted to make a lot of memories.

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:03.990
But could you please keep this from Nozomu-oniisan?

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:07.110
Nozomu-oniisan is so gentle that if I told him we were moving,

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.440
he’d worry needlessly about us.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:15.990
Soujyu-chan!

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.500
She collapsed suddenly…

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:23.090
Soujyu! Soujyu! SOUJYU!

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.620
Here you go, thanks for waiting.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:26.790
Nozomu-chan!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:28.800
It’s terrible! Soujyu-chan…

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:44.830
She’ll be fine. It’s nothing serious.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:48.860
She has mild anemia. Just leave her alone for a while and she’ll come around.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:02.290
Ah, it’s missing one.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.530
Where are you going?

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.160
That’s dangerous!

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.540
Whoa, be careful!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.050
What’s wrong?

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:21.890
Where did you throw the garbage?

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.370
Huh?

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:23.660
The garbage! The garbage!

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:27.380
Ah, I put it at the campus crossing.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.410
Hey, wait up! Where are you going?

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.890
What the hell are you doing at a time like this?

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:51.260
What did you say? Soujyu’s pastel set was missing one colour.

00:17:51.260 --> 00:17:54.340
Just go and stay by Soujyu’s side!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:57.930
But you know, Soujyu-chan treasured that.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:18:02.690
Idiot! No matter how precious it is, you’ll never find it in this fine mess!

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:03.730
More importantly, go to Soujyu…

00:18:03.730 --> 00:18:06.810
But she said this is a treasured present from Sara-chan.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.770
Eh?

00:18:08.460 --> 00:18:10.690
She said it’s precious.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.160
I’ll search as well.

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.330
Let’s go help them.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.340
Okay.

00:18:28.340 --> 00:18:28.960
Me too.

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.350
Can you help us out a bit?

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:37.320
Sure.

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:45.790
Ah, youth.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.630
Should I go and help too, I wonder.

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:48.730
You’re fine where you are.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:05.870
I got it!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:07.670
Really?

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:09.830
I got it. See?

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:10.840
Wow, that’s great!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.210
Yippie!

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:13.950
Thank god.

00:19:16.650 --> 00:19:18.380
Nozomu-kun, you’re amazing!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:19.880
Amazing!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.180
Way to go, Nozomu-chan!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.510
I have an idea about why Soujyu is drawn to you.

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:35.900
Eh?

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.990
But I still don’t accept you
or anything, okay?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.500
Huh? What happened with these?

00:19:56.150 --> 00:20:00.830
Oh, those girls came by early in the morning to deliver them.

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.010
Anybody home?

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.030
What’s the matter, Kaoruko-chan? Sumireko-chan?

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.600
We were a little hesitant,

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:13.500
but we decided it would be best to talk to you about it, Nozomu-chan. Right?

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:14.020
Yes.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:15.550
Huh?

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.060
Are you sure this is okay?
Leaving without telling him…

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:30.410
Yes, since today is a school day. And besides, he’s busy studying for his entrance exams.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.290
I don’t want to bother him.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.100
This is no good, I won’t make it to the station in time.

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:10.830
What’s the matter?

00:21:17.530 --> 00:21:19.000
Nozomu-oniisan!

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:28.810
I’m sure that we’ll come back to this town someday, won’t we?

00:21:28.810 --> 00:21:29.510
Yes.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:58.000
dokomademo tsuzuku sora

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:58.000
Oh, the sky that continues no matter where you go…

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:04.050
daisuki na kono machi de

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:04.050
In this town that I love…

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.010
takusan no omoide to, hora,

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:10.010
With all our memories, now look!

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:16.020
onaji dake hohoende

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:16.020
We are smiling the same way

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:26.700
itsudemo kimi no tonari ni iyoutoshiteru no wa

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:26.700
To always be trying to be besides you…

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
mukashi kara no kuse datte omotteru kedo

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:39.020
…is, I believe, a bad habit I’ve had for a long time

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
“mata ashita” tte te wo furu toki ni wa

00:22:39.020 --> 00:22:45.140
When we wave our hands saying “see you tomorrow,”

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
sukoshi dake samishii kigasuru yo

00:22:45.140 --> 00:22:50.930
I realize that I’m feeling a little lonely at that moment

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
tooku naru kimi no senaka mitsumete

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:57.230
Staring at your back that is getting further away,

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
nandaka, fushigi na kimochi

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:03.190
For some reason, a mysterious feeling…

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
kono mune ni hirogatte yuku

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:09.090
…is spreading through this heart of mine

00:23:10.930 --> 00:23:13.030
The town’s abuzz with Christmas.

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:15.950
Nozomu-oniisan and the others are having a party.

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.120
We’d like to go, wouldn’t we, Sara-chan?

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:20.960
If you go to a place like that you’ll get tired and fall sick again, Soujyu.

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time – Triangle Christmas
